{"t": 1794105923.2267363, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout.promo.normalize_code` (checkout/promo.py):\n\n```python\ndef normalize_code(code: str) -> str:\n    return code.strip().replace(\" \", \"\").upper()\n```\n\nThis strips surrounding whitespace, removes inner spaces, and upper-cases the code before lookup, addressing Sentry issue CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q (`PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`).\n\nVerified locally: `' autumn24 '`, `'autumn 24'` and `'autumn24'` all normalise to `AUTUMN24`.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
